#: ../../tools/rcsb_search_tools.rst:32 912a7693e2eb469da220d3627d906448
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for protein structures similar to a given PDB ID "
"or sequence using RCSB PDB structure similarity search. Supports "
"sequence-based, structure-based, and text-based search. Suitable for "
"antibodies, proteins, and other biologics. Use text search to find PDB "
"IDs by drug name, protein name, or keywords."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_search_tools.rst:34 bbd1ce856fa14db6a53d882362f344cd
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_search_tools.rst:36 941e708c9ca8493ab039e35eadc586c9
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) PDB ID (e.g., '1ABC'), protein sequence "
"(amino acids), or search text (e.g., drug name, protein name, keyword). "
"For structure search, provide PDB ID. For sequence search, provide amino "
"acid sequence. For text search, provide drug name, protein name, or "
"keyword."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_search_tools.rst:39 beaea9507840469abddf7efb49996c02
msgid ""
"``search_type`` (string) (optional) Type of search: 'sequence' for "
"sequence-based similarity search, 'structure' for structure-based "
"similarity search using PDB ID, 'text' for text-based search by name or "
"keyword"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_search_tools.rst:42 0425b844fa3d47aeace0b2eb46e0b585
msgid ""
"``similarity_threshold`` (number) (optional) Similarity threshold (0-1). "
"Higher values return more similar structures. Values outside 0-1 will be "
"clamped. For sequence search, this is the identity cutoff. For structure "
"search, this is the structure similarity threshold. Not used for text "
"search."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rcsb_search_tools.rst:45 0a7eeeac5bc24eb78cc278ffc5c0ff8c
msgid ""
"``max_results`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of results to return "
"(1-100). Values outside this range will be clamped."
msgstr ""

